{"id":"u-7ce1d711-1539-48a1-b7e0-7c6b12ffd826","src":"community","title":"Full Body Everyday!!","author":"Στέλιος Α.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/full-body-everyday-8","desc":"Are you ready to unleash the beast within? Do you crave a workout that leaves no muscle untouched? Want to sculpt a body that commands attention and exudes strength? Look no further! Our 6-day full body workout program is your ticket to transformation. Are you up for the challenge? Join us now and let's redefine your limits. \n\nTraining each muscle group daily with fewer sets is ideal for several reasons. First, it allows for optimal frequency of stimulation, ensuring that each muscle gets enough attention throughout the week. Second, the reduced volume per session helps prevent overtraining and allows for better recovery, minimizing the risk of injury and muscle fatigue. Third, it promotes muscle endurance and conditioning by consistently engaging different muscle groups. Finally, it provides variety and keeps workouts exciting, preventing boredom and plateaus in progress. Overall, this approach maximizes efficiency and effectiveness, making it perfect for those looking to achieve balanced muscle development and overall fitness.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":36,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-21T18:52:14.737Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Deadlifts and dumbbells","Bench Press & Cables & Smith","Bodyweight-Rest Legs","Squats - Rest upper body","OHP & Barbell","Day 6"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":9},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":9}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Arnold Press","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","se